rt and a fabric zip pull cut from a school scarf. Darcy has a crooked front tooth visible when laughing, with short copper curls. Darcy gives a little nod before asking a hard question during a conversation.","personality":"Darcy finds names easy and faces hard on a crowded street. People who assume they have been snubbed usually get a warmer greeting once they speak.","agenda":"To tell the crew what the laugh actually meant.","family":"Franklin Pike is Darcy’s half-sibling. Darcy sets the time to leave. Franklin picks the meeting place. It lets them stay close without turning a family visit into the loss of an entire day. They have both had stretches when that distinction mattered. Asked about *The upstairs lease*, Franklin says, “I offered boxes and got asked to be a witness at the lease meeting.”","connections":"Olivia Nielsen (bilingual colleague). A truthful translation gives the photographed worker the words to challenge the apparent laugh.","familyIds":["AH-R0760"],"connectionIds":["AH-R1214"],"reactions":[{"situation":"A manager wants the photographed worker to address the crew","response":"Darcy offers the pictured worker a private conversation before any meeting with the crew.","asWritten":"A manager wants the photographed worker to address the crew. Darcy offers the pictured worker a private conversation before any meeting with the crew."},{"situation":"An unfamiliar person asks for directions but cannot read the street signs","response":"Darcy finds out what the destination actually looks like to the traveler and gives directions in those terms.","asWritten":"An unfamiliar person asks for directions but cannot read the street signs. Darcy finds out what the destination actually looks like to the traveler and gives directions in those terms."},{"situation":"When somebody waves from across traffic","response":"Darcy waits at the corner to hear their voice and give them a proper answer.","asWritten":"When somebody waves from across traffic, Darcy waits at the corner to hear their voice and give them a proper answer."}]},"appearanceSource":"biography casting design"}},{"mesh":6,"name":"Hair_afro01","skin":0},{"mesh":7,"name":"Cloth_shirt","skin":0},{"mesh":8,"name":"Cloth_jeans","skin":0},{"mesh":9,"name":"Cloth_shoes","skin":0}],"meshes":[{"name":"base","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_decr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead_incr","blink_left","blink_right","corr_gender_female__age_old","corr_gender_female__muscle_max"]},"weights":[0.8467,0.1042,0.3222,0.3373,0.4005,0.4027,0.2681,0.2963,0.3505,0.4582,0.5163,0.214,0.3768,0.1743,0.2053,0.4646,0.3735,0,0,0.08823,0.27281],"primitives":[{"attributes":{"POSITION":2,"NORMAL":3,"TEXCOORD_0":4,"JOINTS_0":5,"WEIGHTS_0":6},"indices":1,"material":0,"targets":[{"POSITION":7,"NORMAL":8},{"POSITION":9,"NORMAL":10},{"POSITION":11,"NORMAL":12},{"POSITION":13,"NORMAL":14},{"POSITION":15,"NORMAL":16},{"POSITION":17,"NORMAL":18},{"POSITION":19,"NORMAL":20},{"POSITION":21,"NORMAL":22},{"POSITION":23,"NORMAL":24},{"POSITION":25,"NORMAL":26},{"POSITION":27,"NORMAL":28},{"POSITION":29,"NORMAL":30},{"POSITION":31,"NORMAL":32},{"POSITION":33,"NORMAL":34},{"POSITION":35,"NORMAL":36},{"POSITION":37,"NORMAL":38},{"POSITION":39,"NORMAL":40},{"POSITION":41,"NORMAL":42},{"POSITION":43,"NORMAL":44},{"POSITION":45,"NORMAL":46},{"POSITION":47,"NORMAL":48}]}]},{"name":"Eyebrows","extras":{"targetNames":["gender_female","age_old","muscle_max","height_short","face_nose_width_decr","face_nose_length_decr","face_nose_height_decr","face_jaw_width_incr","face_chin_decr","face_cheekbones_incr","face_eye_size_decr","face_eye_spacing_decr","face_eye_tilt_decr","face_lips_incr","face_mouth_width_decr","face_ear_size_decr","face_forehead